    "stars": 4,
    "text": "De dürüm op zich was lekker, maar ze doen er standaard iets van aardappel doorheen en dat was echt jammer. Het personeel is echt super vriendelijk. De muziek was erg hard, maar dat is ook de vibe die ze willen neerzetten, dus past wel. Al met al best okay, maar volgende keer ga ik ergens anders voor de döner.",
    "textTranslated": "The dürüm itself was tasty, but they add some kind of potato to it as standard, and that was really a shame. The staff is really super friendly. The music was very loud, but that is the vibe they want to create, so it fits. All in all pretty okay, but next time I'll go somewhere else for the döner."
  },
